      "day": 128,
      "line": "🐀 The rat's eyes INFLATE — and it posts its demands, a real readable list: 1. 3 rounds of stillness (no movement) | 2. your best tool (dropped) (Meet one: the strike ends. Or scab the grid's job yourself. The strike is always announced.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 128,
      "line": "🐀 Demand met. The strike is over — the rat deflates to a normal (house-sized, still alarming) rat and leaves. (Non-violent resolution.)"
