      "day": 128,
      "line": "You lived to tell it — The Strike's moves are burned into your memory. (1/2 — one more survived encounter and you'll have its trick.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 128,
      "line": "💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Ugly-Eyes: Buy it off. It steals FIRST and fights second — but it CANNOT resist food. OFFER FOOD in the fight: it drops your things mid-scamper for the meal. A bribe is cheaper than a chase. (Two survived encounters — the fire has a theory.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 130,
      "line": "💛 You hold Dog tags. Not yours. Hilda's. You carry them so someone is remembered — the promise you made in the dust. Hilda would laugh at you carrying them into the apocalypse. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)"
